{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0033_1004_p", "source_sha256": "c008298a0dfeab6e3028b062bc21c88f9ab4dcc0ec21035246f95741ea429734", "ja": "そうは言っても、凄まじいことになってたしな……\n担当アイドルに風邪をひかせるわけにはいかないよ。", "zh": "话虽如此，但成果也已经够惊人了……\n再说我也不能让担当偶像感冒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0033_1005_044miz", "source_sha256": "14c891f2508ceaa737acd1ba948305f60d8771e8b023db58bcf4788d35377aaa", "ja": "はい。なので、今回は諦めます。", "zh": "是的，所以这次我就放弃了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0033_1006_p", "source_sha256": "a962ef721a4911b8e10ae52c089038443b2577dc29841f7319fad8042828dd4f", "ja": "それにしても、ずいぶん熱心だったな。\nそんなに楽しかったのか？　お城作り……。", "zh": "不过你还真是充满热情呢。\n盖沙堡有这么开心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0033_1007_044miz", "source_sha256": "324be5ad63e7de2ec5f0310c088e1624c0a018e72ea01828de83eb53822e5d3f", "ja": "はい。それに……。", "zh": "是啊，而且……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0033_1008_044miz", "source_sha256": "7cf2aaa9b4b6eb9e94ddaf6eded956759ad3471ff990fd531e361f2cc2b4e7d5", "ja": "ステージの熱が、まだ残っていたので。\nもう少し、ここにいたかったんだと思います。", "zh": "应该是因为表演的余韵还在，\n所以我才想在这里多待一会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0033_1009_p", "source_sha256": "0afc9750544073060a7e3051e13a2d43cdb4bb1026b9245cfa95b4d6215d421d", "ja": "そうか。\nステージ、頑張ってたもんな。", "zh": "这样啊。\n毕竟你很努力在表演呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0033_1010_p", "source_sha256": "a8eea09ac1c3ac9e0871f0c7758d61ca077d4df14553c33043931a4b69060e80", "ja": "砂のお城は、いつか崩れてしまうけど……\n瑞希が一生懸命やった想い出は、残ったな。", "zh": "虽然沙堡总有一天会崩塌……\n但瑞希努力过的回忆却会留下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0033_1011_044miz", "source_sha256": "df5a2a9ae5a01e6571864561f194a576b80e13db807967adb9167be4314af458", "ja": "はい。だから何度でも、挑戦したいと思います。\nお城作りも、ライブも。", "zh": "是的，所以无论几次，我都想再挑战。\n不管是盖沙堡，或是演唱会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
